(text "C701/C702: 10 uF, 25 V X5R; input/output bypass, minimum 1 uF effective.\nAP2112 SOT25 dissipation and output capacitance require first-article measurement." (at 60.96 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "056a3c8e-40ed-4976-84b8-e809ba87cc14"))
(text "LCD J701: user carrier numbering, opposite manufacturer J1 numbering.\nCarrier 1/BL connects to module 8/BL_E. Carrier 8/3V3 connects to module 1/VCC.\nUse the module J1 2.54 mm row, not its separate J2 2 mm connector.\nJP201/203/205 closed; JP202/204/206 open. Backlight always on by default." (at 60.96 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "dd2deceb-453f-4529-8940-ded71614705c"))
